@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
skinparam ParticipantFontColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left

participant "<u>:LogicManager</u>" as Logic LOGIC_COLOR
participant "<u>:GameMatesParser</u>" as Router LOGIC_COLOR
participant "<u>:ArchiveCommandParser</u>" as Parser LOGIC_COLOR
participant "<u>command:ArchiveCommand</u>" as Command LOGIC_COLOR
participant "<u>model:ModelManager</u>" as Model MODEL_COLOR
participant "<u>friend:Friend</u>" as Friend MODEL_COLOR
participant "<u>:StorageManager</u>" as Storage STORAGE_COLOR

[-> Logic : execute("archive 1")
activate Logic
Logic -> Router : parseCommand("archive 1")
activate Router
create Parser
Router -> Parser : ArchiveCommandParser()
Router -> Parser : parse(" 1")
activate Parser
note over Parser
ParserUtil.parseIndex(" 1") returns index.
Index parsing details are omitted.
end note
create Command
Parser -> Command : ArchiveCommand(index)
Parser --> Router : command
deactivate Parser
Router --> Logic : command
deactivate Router

Logic -> Command : execute(model)
activate Command
Command -> Model : getFriendListScope()
activate Model
Model --> Command : scope
deactivate Model
note over Command, Model
Successful scenario: scope is ACTIVE or SEARCH,
and displayed index 1 exists.
end note
Command -> Model : getFilteredFriendList()
activate Model
Model --> Command : displayedFriends
deactivate Model
note over Command
Check the displayed index and select friend.
Repeated list access and collection calls are omitted.
end note
Command -> Friend : isArchived()
activate Friend
Friend --> Command : false
deactivate Friend
Command -> Friend : withArchived(true)
activate Friend
note right of Friend
Creates a new Friend, preserving
all other fields. The original
Friend remains unchanged.
end note
Friend --> Command : archivedFriend
deactivate Friend
Command -> Model : setFriend(friend, archivedFriend)
activate Model
note over Model, Friend
Replace the friend in the existing collection.
The observable view updates with the same scope and filter:
ACTIVE hides the friend; SEARCH retains the matching friend.
end note
Model --> Command
deactivate Model
note over Command
Construct result with feedback "Archived FRIEND_NAME."
Result construction and name access are omitted.
end note
Command --> Logic : result
deactivate Command

Logic -> Model : getGameMates()
activate Model
Model --> Logic : gameMates
deactivate Model
Logic -> Storage : saveGameMates(gameMates)
activate Storage
Storage --> Logic
deactivate Storage
[<-- Logic : result
deactivate Logic
@enduml
